<title>USA: La-Man extends warrant exercise deadline.</title>
<headline>La-Man extends warrant exercise deadline.</headline>
<dateline>ORLANDO, Fla. 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>La-Man Corp said Thursday it has extended by a year the expiration date of its redeemable common stock purchase warrants at the present exercise price of $4.76 per share.</p>
<p>The commercial sign manufacturer said the deadline has been extended to June 30, 1998.</p>
</text>
